otente panel de administraci&oacute;n. <strong>Todo lo que necesitas para gestionar una tienda online seria.</strong></p>\n</div>\n<!-- Button Group -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-2\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-duration=\"600\" data-aos-delay=\"300\" data-aos-offset=\"40\" data-aos-easing=\"ease-out-cubic\" data-aos-once=\"true\"><!-- Browse Demo Store --> <a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 group\" title=\"Explorar la Tienda de Demostraci&oacute;n\" href=\"[site_url]/shop\"> <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M3 3h2l.4 2M7 13h10l4-8H5.4M7 13L5.4 5M7 13l-2.293 2.293c-.63.63-.184 1.707.707 1.707H17m0 0a2 2 0 100 4 2 2 0 000-4zm-8 2a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\"></path>\n                        </svg> Explorar la Tienda de Demostraci&oacute;n </a> <!-- View Documentation --> <a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm font-bold rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-600 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200 group\" title=\"Documentaci&oacute;n de Site Store Pro\" href=\"https://docs.sitestorepro.com/introduction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4