\"60\" data-aos-easing=\"ease-out-cubic\" data-aos-once=\"true\">Fidèle à des marques de premier plan</p>\n<div class=\"max-w-[900px] mx-auto mb-10\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-duration=\"600\" data-aos-offset=\"60\" data-aos-easing=\"ease-out-cubic\" data-aos-once=\"true\">[plugin:brands-2026]</div>\n<!-- Divider -->\n<div class=\"border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 mb-8\">&nbsp;</div>\n<!-- Benefits Grid -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-left\"><a class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 flex items-center gap-3 hover:border-indigo-400 dark:hover:border-indigo-500/70 hover:bg-indigo-50/60 dark:hover:bg-indigo-900/20 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200 group\" href=\"[site_url]/shipping-policy\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-duration=\"500\" data-aos-delay=\"0\" data-aos-offset=\"60\" data-aos-easing=\"ease-out-cubic\" data-aos-once=\"true\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/40 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 8h14M5 8a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 8v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V8m-9 4h4\"></path>\n                        </svg></div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 group-hover:text-indigo-700 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors\">Livraison gratuite</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\">Sur toutes les commandes de plus de 50 $</p>\n</div>\n</a><a class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 flex items-center gap-3