INSERT IGNORE INTO `cms_pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `cms_search_index`, `cms_search_index_locked`, `author_id`, `expires_at`, `requires_code`, `access_code`, `required_product_id`, `custom_css`, `custom_js`, `header_image`, `background_image`, `background_video`, `background_video_url`, `background_video_type`, `background_video_s3`, `background_video_region`, `background_video_bucket_name`, `background_video_access_key_id`, `background_video_secret_access_key`, `background_video_cdn_url`, `alternate_page_title`, `page_title_alignment`, `page_title_css`, `include_slideshow`, `min_header_height`, `is_active`, `exclude_from_search`, `page_type`, `page_ranking`, `hide_page_ranking`, `custom_sorting`, `layout_type`, `left_col`, `right_col`, `custom_author`, `show_author`, `show_title`, `show_date`, `featured_image`, `featured_image_s3`, `featured_image_region`, `featured_image_bucket_name`, `featured_image_access_key_id`, `featured_image_secret_access_key`, `media_image_s3`, `media_image_region`, `media_image_bucket_name`, `media_image_access_key_id`, `media_image_secret_access_key`, `featured_image_cdn_url`, `media_image_cdn_url`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (5, 'Terms of Service', 'terms', '<div class=\"prose prose-slate max-w-none\" style=\"max-width: none !important; width: 100%;\">\n<h2>Terms of Service</h2>\n<p>These Terms of Service (\"Terms\") govern your access to and use of this website and any services, products, digital downloads, and event registrations made available through it. By accessing or using the platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the site or make purchases.</p>\n<h3>1. Changes to These Terms</h3>\n<p>We may amend these Terms at any time. Changes become effective when posted on the site. Your continued use after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms. It is your responsibility to review these Terms periodically.</p>\n<h3>2. Eligibility</h3>\n<p>You must be at least 18 years old (or the age of majority in your jurisdiction) and have the legal capacity to enter into contracts to use the site and make purchases. By placing an order, you represent that you meet these requirements.</p>\n<h3>3. Account Registration and Security</h3>\n<p>Some features require an account. You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information and to keep your account credentials secure. You are responsible for all activity under your account. Notify support immediately of any unauthorized use or security breach.</p>\n<h3>4. Purchases, Pricing, and Payment</h3>\n<p>All orders are subject to product availability and confirmation of payment. Prices shown are in the currency indicated and do not include applicable taxes and shipping unless stated. We reserve the right to correct pricing errors and to refuse or cancel orders placed with incorrect prices. Payment methods accepted are displayed at checkout.</p>\n<h4>Taxes and Duties</h4>\n<p>Buyers are responsible for any applicable taxes, duties, or customs fees for international shipments. We may collect tax at checkout where required by law.</p>\n<h3>5. Shipping and Delivery (Shippable Products)</h3>\n<p>Shipping options, carriers, and delivery estimates are provided at checkout. Estimated delivery times are not guaranteed and are subject to carrier schedules and customs processing for international orders. Risk of loss and title for physical goods pass to you when the carrier accepts the goods for shipment.</p>\n<p>We are not responsible for delays caused by carrier issues, customs, or circumstances beyond our control. If a shipment is lost or damaged in transit, please contact support so we can assist with carrier claims.</p>\n<h3>6. Returns, Refunds, and Exchanges</h3>\n<p>Our return and refund practices differ by product type. The following describes general policies; specific product listings may include additional terms.</p>\n<h4>Physical Goods</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Physical goods may be returned within 30 days of purchase if unused and in original packaging, unless otherwise stated.</li>\n<li>You are generally responsible for return shipping costs unless the return is due to our error (e.g., wrong or defective item).</li>\n<li>Returned items must be accompanied by proof of purchase. Refunds will be issued to the original payment method after we inspect the returned item. Refund processing may take several business days.</li>\n<li>We may refuse returns that do not meet the above conditions or are returned outside the return period.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Digital Products and Downloads</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Digital products and downloadable files are typically delivered immediately upon order confirmation.</li>\n<li>Digital purchases are generally non-refundable once delivered, except where required by law or where a technical delivery failure prevents access to the product.</li>\n<li>If you experience download or access issues, open a support ticket with details so we can assist. If a refund is approved for a digital product, you must cease use and delete any copies; license access may be revoked.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Event Registrations and Tickets</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Event registrations are subject to the event&rsquo;s specific cancellation, transfer, and refund policy. Check the event details before purchase.</li>\n<li>Refunds for event registrations may be available within a limited window prior to the event start date; otherwise tickets may be non-refundable. Transfers of registration to another person may be permitted subject to availability and fees.</li>\n<li>If an event is canceled by the organizer, you will be notified and given options such as refund, credit, or transfer to a rescheduled date. We are not responsible for travel or other expenses you may incur.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Request a Return or Refund</h4>\n<p>To request a return or report a delivery or download issue, contact customer support with your order number, the item(s) affected, and a description of the problem. Provide any requested documentation (photos of damaged items, error messages, etc.). We will review and respond within a reasonable timeframe.</p>\n<div style=\"border-left: 4px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 10px 15px; background: #f8fafc;\"><strong>Note:</strong> Approved refunds for goods are issued to the original payment method. Refunds may take several business days to appear on your statement, depending on your payment provider.</div>\n<h3>7. Licenses, Usage Rights, and Restrictions (Digital Content)</h3>\n<p>Unless explicitly stated otherwise, purchases of digital products grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use the content for your personal or internal business use only. Unless permitted by separate agreement, you may not:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Resell, sublicense, distribute, or make available the digital product to third parties;</li>\n<li>Remove or obscure any proprietary notices or marks;</li>\n<li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or attempt to extract source code or underlying data;</li>\n<li>Use the content in a manner that violates applicable laws or third-party rights.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>8. Event Participation and Code of Conduct</h3>\n<p>By registering for and attending events, you agree to comply with the event&rsquo;s rules and directions from organizers and staff. Unruly, illegal, or unsafe behavior may result in removal without refund. You are responsible for your own travel, lodging, and personal expenses unless otherwise specified.</p>\n<h3>9. User Content and Submissions</h3>\n<p>If you submit reviews, comments, or other content, you grant a non-exclusive, royalty-free, worldwide license to use, reproduce, modify, and display that content in connection with the site and its promotion. Do not submit content you do not own or have permission to use. We may remove content at our discretion.</p>\n<h3>10. Intellectual Property</h3>\n<p>All site content, including text, graphics, logos, images, software, and digital products, is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws. Other than the limited license expressly granted above, we retain all rights, title, and interest in our content.</p>\n<h3>11. Third-Party Links and Services</h3>\n<p>The site may contain links to third-party websites, products, or services. We do not control and are not responsible for the content or practices of third parties. Links do not imply endorsement. Use third-party services at your own risk and review their terms and privacy policies.</p>\n<h3>12. Warranties and Disclaimers</h3>\n<p>The site and all products and services are provided \"as is\" and \"as available\" without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. To the fullest extent permitted by law, we disclaim all warranties, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. We do not warrant uninterrupted or error-free operation, or that products meet your requirements.</p>\n<h3>13. Limitation of Liability</h3>\n<p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, in no event will we be liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or exemplary damages arising from or related to your use of the site or products, even if advised of the possibility of such damages. Our aggregate liability for any claims related to your use of the site or purchase of products is limited to the amount you paid for the specific product or service that gives rise to the claim.</p>\n<h3>14. Indemnification</h3>\n<p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless us, our affiliates, and our respective officers, directors, employees, and agents from any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys&rsquo; fees) arising from your breach of these Terms, your violation of applicable law, or your use of the site.</p>\n<h3>15. Termination</h3>\n<p>We may suspend or terminate your access to the site and services at any time, with or without notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users or third parties. Termination does not affect rights and obligations that arose prior to termination.</p>\n<h3>16. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution</h3>\n<p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the jurisdiction specified in our legal notices or as otherwise required by applicable law. Disputes will be handled in the courts located in that jurisdiction unless alternative dispute resolution (such as arbitration) is specified. If you are a consumer, local consumer protection laws may apply.</p>\n<h3>17. Force Majeure</h3>\n<p>We are not liable for failure to perform due to causes beyond our reasonable control, including but not limited to acts of God, natural disasters, pandemics, labor disputes, acts of government, or failures of telecommunications or internet providers.</p>\n<h3>18. Promotions, Coupons, and Gift Cards</h3>\n<p>Promotional offers, coupon codes, and gift cards are subject to separate terms and expiration dates. Promotions cannot be combined unless explicitly allowed. Abuse of promotions may result in cancellation of orders or accounts.</p>\n<h3>19. Privacy</h3>\n<p>We collect and process personal information in accordance with our [page:17 label=\"Privacy Statement\"]. By using the site, you consent to such collection and processing. Review our [page:17 label=\"Privacy Statement\"] for details about how we handle personal data.</p>\n<h3>20. Contact and Support</h3>\n<p>If you have questions about these Terms, need assistance with an order, or need to report a problem with a digital delivery, please [page:16 label=\"Contact Us\"]. Include your order number and a clear description of the issue for faster assistance.</p>\n<p>By placing an order or using the site, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to these Terms of Service.</p>\n</div>', 'Terms of Service', 'Terms of service governing purchases, digital downloads, and support ticket policies.', 'Terms of Service terms Terms of Service Terms of service governing purchases, digital downloads, and support ticket policies. Terms of Service These Terms of Service (\"Terms\") govern your access to and use of this website and any services, products, digital downloads, and event registrations made available through it. By accessing or using the platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the site or make purchases. 1. Changes to These Terms We may amend these Terms at any time. Changes become effective when posted on the site. Your continued use after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms. It is your responsibility to review these Terms periodically. 2. Eligibility You must be at least 18 years old (or the age of majority in your jurisdiction) and have the legal capacity to enter into contracts to use the site and make purchases. By placing an order, you represent that you meet these requirements. 3. Account Registration and Security Some features require an account. You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information and to keep your account credentials secure. You are responsible for all activity under your account. Notify support immediately of any unauthorized use or security breach. 4. Purchases, Pricing, and Payment All orders are subject to product availability and confirmation of payment. Prices shown are in the currency indicated and do not include applicable taxes and shipping unless stated. We reserve the right to correct pricing errors and to refuse or cancel orders placed with incorrect prices. Payment methods accepted are displayed at checkout. Taxes and Duties Buyers are responsible for any applicable taxes, duties, or customs fees for international shipments. We may collect tax at checkout where required by law. 5. Shipping and Delivery (Shippable Products) Shipping options, carriers, and delivery estimates are provided at checkout. Estimated delivery times are not guaranteed and are subject to carrier schedules and customs processing for international orders. Risk of loss and title for physical goods pass to you when the carrier accepts the goods for shipment. We are not responsible for delays caused by carrier issues, customs, or circumstances beyond our control. If a shipment is lost or damaged in transit, please contact support so we can assist with carrier claims. 6. Returns, Refunds, and Exchanges Our return and refund practices differ by product type. The following describes general policies; specific product listings may include additional terms. Physical Goods Physical goods may be returned within 30 days of purchase if unused and in original packaging, unless otherwise stated. You are generally responsible for return shipping costs unless the return is due to our error (e.g., wrong or defective item). Returned items must be accompanied by proof of purchase. Refunds will be issued to the original payment method after we inspect the returned item. Refund processing may take several business days. We may refuse returns that do not meet the above conditions or are returned outside the return period. Digital Products and Downloads Digital products and downloadable files are typically delivered immediately upon order confirmation. Digital purchases are generally non-refundable once delivered, except where required by law or where a technical delivery failure prevents access to the product. If you experience download or access issues, open a support ticket with details so we can assist. If a refund is approved for a digital product, you must cease use and delete any copies; license access may be revoked. Event Registrations and Tickets Event registrations are subject to the event&rsquo;s specific cancellation, transfer, and refund policy. Check the event details before purchase. Refunds for event registrations may be available within a limited window prior to the event start date; otherwise tickets may be non-refundable. Transfers of registration to another person may be permitted subject to availability and fees. If an event is canceled by the organizer, you will be notified and given options such as refund, credit, or transfer to a rescheduled date. We are not responsible for travel or other expenses you may incur. How to Request a Return or Refund To request a return or report a delivery or download issue, contact customer support with your order number, the item(s) affected, and a description of the problem. Provide any requested documentation (photos of damaged items, error messages, etc.). We will review and respond within a reasonable timeframe. Note: Approved refunds for goods are issued to the original payment method. Refunds may take several business days to appear on your statement, depending on your payment provider. 7. Licenses, Usage Rights, and Restrictions (Digital Content) Unless explicitly stated otherwise, purchases of digital products grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use the content for your personal or internal business use only. Unless permitted by separate agreement, you may not: Resell, sublicense, distribute, or make available the digital product to third parties; Remove or obscure any proprietary notices or marks; Reverse engineer, decompile, or attempt to extract source code or underlying data; Use the content in a manner that violates applicable laws or third-party rights. 8. Event Participation and Code of Conduct By registering for and attending events, you agree to comply with the event&rsquo;s rules and directions from organizers and staff. Unruly, illegal, or unsafe behavior may result in removal without refund. You are responsible for your own travel, lodging, and personal expenses unless otherwise specified. 9. User Content and Submissions If you submit reviews, comments, or other content, you grant a non-exclusive, royalty-free, worldwide license to use, reproduce, modify, and display that content in connection with the site and its promotion. Do not submit content you do not own or have permission to use. We may remove content at our discretion. 10. Intellectual Property All site content, including text, graphics, logos, images, software, and digital products, is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws. Other than the limited license expressly granted above, we retain all rights, title, and interest in our content. 11. Third-Party Links and Services The site may contain links to third-party websites, products, or services. We do not control and are not responsible for the content or practices of third parties. Links do not imply endorsement. Use third-party services at your own risk and review their terms and privacy policies. 12. Warranties and Disclaimers The site and all products and services are provided \"as is\" and \"as available\" without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. To the fullest extent permitted by law, we disclaim all warranties, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. We do not warrant uninterrupted or error-free operation, or that products meet your requirements. 13. Limitation of Liability To the maximum extent permitted by law, in no event will we be liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or exemplary damages arising from or related to your use of the site or products, even if advised of the possibility of such damages. Our aggregate liability for any claims related to your use of the site or purchase of products is limited to the amount you paid for the specific product or service that gives rise to the claim. 14. Indemnification You agree to indemnify and hold harmless us, our affiliates, and our respective officers, directors, employees, and agents from any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys&rsquo; fees) arising from your breach of these Terms, your violation of applicable law, or your use of the site. 15. Termination We may suspend or terminate your access to the site and services at any time, with or without notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users or third parties. Termination does not affect rights and obligations that arose prior to termination. 16. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution These Terms are governed by the laws of the jurisdiction specified in our legal notices or as otherwise required by applicable law. Disputes will be handled in the courts located in that jurisdiction unless alternative dispute resolution (such as arbitration) is specified. If you are a consumer, local consumer protection laws may apply. 17. Force Majeure We are not liable for failure to perform due to causes beyond our reasonable control, including but not limited to acts of God, natural disasters, pandemics, labor disputes, acts of government, or failures of telecommunications or internet providers. 18. Promotions, Coupons, and Gift Cards Promotional offers, coupon codes, and gift cards are subject to separate terms and expiration dates. Promotions cannot be combined unless explicitly allowed. Abuse of promotions may result in cancellation of orders or accounts. 19. Privacy We collect and process personal information in accordance with our . By using the site, you consent to such collection and processing. Review our for details about how we handle personal data. 20. Contact and Support If you have questions about these Terms, need assistance with an order, or need to report a problem with a digital delivery, please . Include your order number and a clear description of the issue for faster assistance. By placing an order or using the site, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to these Terms of Service.', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'local', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'middle-center', NULL, NULL, '320px', 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NUL